ARM Disk Optimizer v1.1  (DEFRAG.EXE)
Full-screen disk defragmenter for ARM-DOS.
Animated cluster map, Full Optimization or
Unfragment Files Only, directory sorting,
mouse support.  FAT12 and FAT16 drives.
Crash-safe: every cluster is copied and
verified before the FAT is changed.
Shareware from Europa Micro Systems.
